# Metadata for JSON-LD (.jsonld) RDF test data

This folder holds collected JSON-LD test files used to exercise the
reader-rdf JSON-LD parser. The files come from four sources:

- W3C test suites (w3c-*.jsonld and fromRdf-NNNN-out.jsonld):
  fragments and expected outputs from the W3C JSON-LD API / RDF test
  suites. The fromRdf-NNNN-out.jsonld files are the EXPECTED JSON-LD
  outputs produced when converting RDF (the matching fromRdf-NNNN-in.nq
  N-Quads inputs, which live under text/rdf/nq/) into JSON-LD.
- DBpedia (dbpedia-*.jsonld): real entity data exported from DBpedia.
- EasyRdf (easyrdf-*.jsonld): the FOAF example fixture from EasyRdf.
- schema.org (schemaorg-current-https.jsonld): the complete schema.org
  vocabulary as one large JSON-LD document.

ddot.it/this ..kind.. collected
ddot.it/this ..format.. format:json-ld
ddot.it/this ..content.. Collected JSON-LD documents (W3C JSON-LD/RDF test-suite fragments and expected fromRdf outputs, DBpedia entity exports, EasyRdf FOAF example, full schema.org vocabulary) for testing the JSON-LD reader.
ddot.it/this ..depicts.. JSON-LD RDF serialization features: @context, @id, @type, @value, @language, typed literals, @list, @graph, blank nodes.


# --- W3C JSON-LD / RDF test suite: w3c-*.jsonld ---
# Small hand-picked fragments from the W3C JSON-LD test suite, each
# isolating one JSON-LD feature.

w3c-0001.jsonld ..kind.. collected
w3c-0001.jsonld ..format.. format:json-ld
w3c-0001.jsonld ..source url.. https://w3c.github.io/rdf-tests/
w3c-0001.jsonld ..license.. W3C Software and Document License / W3C Test Suite License
w3c-0001.jsonld ..tests.. Minimal node: @id plus a single fully-expanded (full-IRI) property -> one literal triple.
w3c-0001.jsonld ..content.. A foaf:name statement using the absolute predicate IRI (no @context).

w3c-0005.jsonld ..kind.. collected
w3c-0005.jsonld ..format.. format:json-ld
w3c-0005.jsonld ..source url.. https://w3c.github.io/rdf-tests/
w3c-0005.jsonld ..license.. W3C Software and Document License / W3C Test Suite License
w3c-0005.jsonld ..tests.. Nested node (implicit blank node) and language-tagged literal (@value + @language "hu").
w3c-0005.jsonld ..content.. foaf:knows pointing at an anonymous node whose foaf:name is "Herman Iván"@hu (UTF-8 accented characters preserved).

w3c-0010.jsonld ..kind.. collected
w3c-0010.jsonld ..format.. format:json-ld
w3c-0010.jsonld ..source url.. https://w3c.github.io/rdf-tests/
w3c-0010.jsonld ..license.. W3C Software and Document License / W3C Test Suite License
w3c-0010.jsonld ..tests.. @context prefix definition and compact-IRI (CURIE) term expansion; nested node with explicit @id.
w3c-0010.jsonld ..content.. foaf prefix in @context; foaf:knows -> node with @id and foaf:name "Manu Sporny".

w3c-0020.jsonld ..kind.. collected
w3c-0020.jsonld ..format.. format:json-ld
w3c-0020.jsonld ..source url.. https://w3c.github.io/rdf-tests/
w3c-0020.jsonld ..license.. W3C Software and Document License / W3C Test Suite License
w3c-0020.jsonld ..tests.. Coerced typed literal via @context term with "@type": "xsd:date".
w3c-0020.jsonld ..content.. dcterms:created "1957-02-27"^^xsd:date defined through a context term.


# --- W3C fromRdf test suite: fromRdf-NNNN-out.jsonld ---
# Expected JSON-LD outputs of the JSON-LD "fromRdf" (RDF -> JSON-LD)
# algorithm. Each is the expected result for the matching
# fromRdf-NNNN-in.nq N-Quads input (under text/rdf/nq/). They are in
# fully-expanded, context-free JSON-LD array form.

