fromRdf-0001-out.jsonld ..format.. format:json-ld
fromRdf-0001-out.jsonld ..source url.. https://w3c.github.io/rdf-tests/
fromRdf-0001-out.jsonld ..license.. W3C Software and Document License / W3C Test Suite License
fromRdf-0001-out.jsonld ..tests.. fromRdf base case: @type array plus IRI object and three literal flavours (plain, xsd:date typed, @language).
