# --- DBpedia entity data: dbpedia-*.jsonld ---

dbpedia-Karlsruhe.jsonld ..kind.. collected
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.jsonld ..format.. format:json-ld
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.jsonld ..source url.. https://dbpedia.org/
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.jsonld ..license.. CC BY-SA 3.0 + GNU FDL
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.jsonld ..tests.. Large real-world JSON-LD with an extensive @context (many term -> IRI mappings, typed terms, @type: @id) and a rich resource description.
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.jsonld ..content.. DBpedia entity data for the city of Karlsruhe (~520 KB).
dbpedia-Karlsruhe.jsonld ..depicts.. dbr:Karlsruhe

dbpedia-berlin.jsonld.toolarge ..kind.. collected
dbpedia-berlin.jsonld.toolarge ..format.. format:json-ld
dbpedia-berlin.jsonld.toolarge ..source url.. https://dbpedia.org/
dbpedia-berlin.jsonld.toolarge ..license.. CC BY-SA 3.0 + GNU FDL
dbpedia-berlin.jsonld.toolarge ..tests.. Not exercised by the test run: a normal JSON-LD file deliberately renamed with a ".toolarge" suffix so the test harness skips it because it is too big (~8.9 MB).
dbpedia-berlin.jsonld.toolarge ..content.. DBpedia entity data for the city of Berlin (a regular JSON-LD document; the suffix is only an exclusion marker, not a separate format).
dbpedia-berlin.jsonld.toolarge ..depicts.. dbr:Berlin


# --- EasyRdf FOAF example: easyrdf-*.jsonld ---

easyrdf-foaf.jsonld ..kind.. collected
easyrdf-foaf.jsonld ..format.. format:json-ld
easyrdf-foaf.jsonld ..source url.. https://github.com/easyrdf/easyrdf
easyrdf-foaf.jsonld ..license.. BSD-3-Clause
easyrdf-foaf.jsonld ..tests.. @context with @vocab default vocabulary, term aliasing, "@type": "@id" coercion, nested objects, and a language-tagged @value.
easyrdf-foaf.jsonld ..content.. FOAF personal-profile fixture from EasyRdf: a PersonalProfileDocument whose primaryTopic is a Person (Joe Bloggs) with a current Project.


# --- schema.org vocabulary: schemaorg-current-https.jsonld ---

schemaorg-current-https.jsonld ..kind.. collected
schemaorg-current-https.jsonld ..format.. format:json-ld
schemaorg-current-https.jsonld ..source url.. https://schema.org/
schemaorg-current-https.jsonld ..license.. CC BY-SA 3.0
schemaorg-current-https.jsonld ..tests.. Very large JSON-LD vocabulary document: big @context with many prefix mappings plus a large @graph of class/property definitions; stress-tests reader scale and @graph handling (~1.5 MB).
schemaorg-current-https.jsonld ..content.. The complete current schema.org vocabulary (all terms, https variant).
schemaorg-current-https.jsonld ..depicts.. The schema.org vocabulary
